{"3595220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pioneer Racing", "steam_appid": 3595220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pioneer Racing</strong> is a competitive racing game focused on performance, upgrades, and chronos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an entry-level car and prove your skill on the track. Race against Bots, push your limits, and unlock faster, more advanced vehicles. Every lap matters: your best times are saved, challenging you to improve with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, freely explore the circuits or fine-tune your car. Adjust performance parameters, customize visuals, and optimize your setup to be even better at each new race. Speed is earned, not given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 maps with 4 presets each</strong> (day, night, rain, night rain): <strong>12 race configurations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 fully detailed cars</strong>, including interior views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced performance customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimap and dynamic racing UI</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple camera views</strong>, including cockpit and rotating around the car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free driving after races</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pioneer Racing is in active development.</strong> Planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (race against others)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New, more detailed circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cars built with high attention to detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI sounds (button clicks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved controls and accessibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new best chronos menu and system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous bug fixes and optimizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is handled by me alone, with a focus on quality and long-term evolution. Updates might be delayed until the new functionalities are important enough. You can expect an update every two months, more or less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback directly influences development. Suggestions are welcome via the YouTube channel and community spaces. Your ideas shape the game into a better, more fun racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race. Improve. Repeat.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pioneer Racing</strong> is a competitive racing game focused on performance, upgrades, and chronos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an entry-level car and prove your skill on the track. Race against Bots, push your limits, and unlock faster, more advanced vehicles. Every lap matters: your best times are saved, challenging you to improve with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, freely explore the circuits or fine-tune your car. Adjust performance parameters, customize visuals, and optimize your setup to be even better at each new race. Speed is earned, not given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 maps with 4 presets each</strong> (day, night, rain, night rain): <strong>12 race configurations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 fully detailed cars</strong>, including interior views</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced performance customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimap and dynamic racing UI</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple camera views</strong>, including cockpit and rotating around the car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free driving after races</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pioneer Racing is in active development.</strong> Planned features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer (race against others)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New, more detailed circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New cars built with high attention to detail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI sounds (button clicks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved controls and accessibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new best chronos menu and system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous bug fixes and optimizations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is handled by me alone, with a focus on quality and long-term evolution. Updates might be delayed until the new functionalities are important enough. You can expect an update every two months, more or less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback directly influences development. Suggestions are welcome via the YouTube channel and community spaces. Your ideas shape the game into a better, more fun racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race. Improve. Repeat.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Competitive racing game focused on performance and lap times. Race against bots, upgrade your cars, beat your best times, and unlock faster vehicles across 12 circuit configurations. Skill-based progression.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595220/af3b8093e7cba6769c904d9f0b3e1e40bef85792/header.jpg?t=1768759703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.